-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Replace hero portrait placeholder with themed headshot.\n\nAdd the formal profile photo to the ID.SCAN frame with vignette and color treatment that matches the dark HUD palette.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Replace placeholder portfolio content with resume-backed production data.\n\nSync case studies, timeline, skills, awards, and certifications from resume and LinkedIn PDFs; polish Kind Words letter preview UX and remove case study screenshot placeholder.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Polish hero identity art, day mode readability, and contact UX.\n\nAdd wireframe operator panel, fix light-mode text contrast, wire cert verify links, and replace technical contact copy with inviting outreach text.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Add live mTrust desk demo, quality proof panel, and hiring CTAs.\n\nShip a synthetic coordinator simulator, Lighthouse-style performance evidence, and open-to-work plus book-a-call flows in contact and navigation.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix Vercel contact API bundling and polish nav and HudFrame labels.\n\nCopy Nest build output into serverless handlers for production Resend delivery, reorder header nav, and prevent DESK.LIVE label clipping.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a98c1a4c9a8bba1763bc5c6b53db0a0e810e9f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/im-kaushal/portfolio-site/git/trees/7a98c1a4c9a8bba1763bc5c6b53db0a0e810e9f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/im-kaushal/portfolio-site/git/commits/df5418eba3d5e8897082dc74b47b6fd8988a289b","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a98c1a4c9a8bba1763bc5c6b53db0a0e810e9f9\nparent fb586fcea8b89c61379ac033e522328c0c2648f0\nauthor Kaushal Kumar <heyyy.kaushal@gmail.com> 1787430112 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787430112 +0530\n\nFeatu