or":{"date":"2026-08-19T15:59:23Z","email":"heyyy.kaushal@gmail.com","name":"Kaushal Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T15:59:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix API 500 crash on Vercel (Nest + Express init) (#3)\n\n* Fix API 500 by letting Nest own the Express instance.\n\nPassing a pre-created express() server into ExpressAdapter triggers\n''app.router is deprecated'' during app.init() on Express 4.22+.\nUse createNestApp() without an instance and forward requests via\ngetHttpAdapter().getInstance() instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: Kaushal Kumar <im-kaushal@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix CI pnpm setup by removing duplicate version pin.\n\npnpm/action-setup@v4 reads packageManager from package.json; the\nexplicit version: 9 in the workflow conflicted with pnpm@9.15.4.\n\nCo-authored-by: Kaushal Kumar <im-kaushal@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Kaushal Kumar <im-kaushal@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9732b991118a4d03735c89bc75e70ac45c05113","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/im-kaushal/portfolio-site/git/trees/b9732b991118a4d03735c89bc75e70ac45c05113"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/im-kaushal/portfolio-site/git/commits/eea29486b415da178e6597ee224ee8540af6faf1","verification":{"payload":"tree b9732b991118a4d03735c89bc75e70ac45c05113\nparent e0e04b0cf4534b1f329afbd6d1f4e4a2bb540db2\nauthor Kaushal Kumar <heyyy.kaushal@gmail.com> 1787155163 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787155163 +0530\n\nFix API 500 crash on Vercel (Nest + Express init) (#3)\n\n* Fix API 500 by letting Nest own the Express instance.\n\nPassing a pre-created express() server into ExpressAdapter triggers\n''app.router is deprecated'' during app.init() on Express 4.22+.\nUse createNestApp() without an instance and forward requests via\ngetHttpAdapter().getInstance() instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: Kaushal Kumar <im-kaushal@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix CI pnpm setup by removing duplicate version pin.\n\npnpm/action-setup@v4 reads packageManager from package.json; the\nexplicit version: 9 in the workflow conflicted with pnpm@9.15.4.\n\nCo-authored-by: Kaushal Kumar <im-kaushal@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Kaushal Kumar <im-kaushal@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhdLbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7XEQAKPd2R6a5MIkRv0BmdATw4CC\ngn/DctfWyt1TFkB5E+r4EuujDX4PRQXLywHNCwe15T9y1Tb4N92ZzeVN6sspduwn\nU9Pv1+Wk99C0QiSwQBkaNVltAFC3rn00OBCUKtilxBRlF3ZeTINADS4FQZDOPwQU\n1tB1n/mh8g3/DAakyi2s96aM/Hqm99flphNGYNPuwfeuINHMubQ2K+8gup45xpDi\nS3lYvmtHWKQMUqWVKgk/i0pYz5KztsD7ObL0JfRnf4gQrvGW8oMSCdSj1jaA3z4k\nufEQgYKqkBOdsEpFT29SpE5MIpLCT/Rdyu4oEWoYHHxHcCTH9utMibJfak/T97GR\nvOgMGGzuwzdt2nBA1qr93E/nrpBX0Ab48cJtm8rlkzqRhQTCugr2bL5v0ydXTHRF\nDBuA0Jy9YuCGeF27WAsIq3rhIsy4YP3+SXJsi+ownckNOVQmAPCHkiPhtz6rzv5Z\ncN89kWaT1XW5mkkcTh36eLoKHeFl92RO39QJfzDspoi7G5M4620tQyki6MJ9X6sh\nWH1cOFe6/G8UZ5wSsB5rDdY23TO/S6Dx84vijQZFrnsXPpRO6dOGI3ExEngsztV7\nwcUUrP+tfElKuLL9AKi4w1vNGEW3BSsTASl1T8/IRc8jw7U2hYb2ya33KdLi9GI/\no+KwD1G2ZhIYwcMq8NYL\n=qajS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-19T15:59:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos