.in","name":"kshitij.sobti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-24T10:27:09Z","email":"kshitij@sobti.in","name":"kshitij.sobti"},"message":"feat: Add plugin slot for login page\n\nThis change adds a plugin slot for the login page allowing it to be customised.\n\nSince there was a dependency conflict between frontend-plugin-framework and the react-hooks testing package, the react-hooks testing package has been removed and a replaced with a simple mechanism for testing hooks.\n\nSince this touched the Login Page those have also been refactored to move away from redux connect.","tree":{"sha":"a4b894ee191e9a6060bcf2af0c9d12786120485f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Israelbbc/frontend-app-authn-inah/git/trees/a4b894ee191e9a6060bcf2af0c9d12786120485f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Israelbbc/frontend-app-authn-inah/git/commits/0418a04fff5cf5d5a6d7f7d6983226433e87d66f","verification":{"payload":"tree a4b894ee191e9a6060bcf2af0c9d12786120485f\nparent 50613911229362ec771f0989ef2ef7350fda2fc6\nauthor kshitij.sobti <kshitij@sobti.in> 1730975293 +0530\ncommitter kshitij.sobti <kshitij@sobti.in> 1761301629 +0530\n\nfeat: Add plugin slot for login page\n\nThis change adds a plugin slot for the login page allowing it to be customised.\n\nSince there was a dependency conflict between frontend-plugin-framework and the react-hooks testing package, the react-hooks testing package has been removed and a replaced with a simple mechanism for testing hooks.\n\nSince this touched the Login Page those have also been refactored to move away from redux connect.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg8AKoEpSF3qtqtQq6O0Q/mX+akk\nZUxSrCu+MyT/LQZ80AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQItzmiKLbxXT57qQRiexP9aJqWJq1JNcTdy/o11VVfZXj36BFDyYLJIAAAJwvXno/e\ndqXZP+PyhWMHuHNBxIRQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T16:13:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"ht