raffeTechnology","id":287057209,"login":"GiraffeTechnology","node_id":"U_kgDOERwlOQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiraffeTechnology/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiraffeTechnology/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiraffeTechnology/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiraffeTechnology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiraffeTechnology/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiraffeTechnology","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GiraffeTechnology/ArtFi/commits/8af87e8c3e3d41ae5d4c6cb0345fb25c342aca0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:49:16Z","email":"abcdyi2021@gmail.com","name":"Michael"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T06:49:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #126: charity delivery, whole-artwork and fractions signature settlement\n\nCharity: PRD.md §7.0''s test-asset markers now render on both charity\nsurfaces, are required in a test-payload batch manifest and forbidden in\nthe real batch''s, and are carried in the Hoodi deployment record. The\nrelease verifier could not have accepted a Hoodi package at all, so step\nI of the Hoodi plan could not have passed at any point; all three gates\nnow branch on §7.0''s two payloads, each branch enforcing isolation rather\nthan relaxing it.\n\nWhole artwork: WholeArtworkMarket.sol adds the ArtFi settlement leg the\nline never had. The seller signs an EIP-712 intent off chain, nothing\ngoes on chain until a fill, and fillIntent moves payment and artwork\natomically with the contract on neither side.\n\nFractions: ArtFiMarket''s fixed-price path now settles by signature with\ncumulative partial fills, as PRD.md §4.2.2 ruled on 2026-08-30. Escrow\nis retained for auctions, which the same ruling keeps.\n\nMerged on local evidence. The quality workflow could not execute on this\nhead: all five jobs failed in two seconds with no runner assigned and no\nsteps recorded, on the first run and again on one re-run. That is the\ninfrastructure failure AGENTS.md already documents twice, not a result\nabout this code, and it affects every pull request rather than this one.\nLocally: forge 135 pass, vitest 125 pass, playwright 118 pass with 2\nskips across desktop and mobile, go vet and gofmt and go test -race pass,\nand format, lint, typecheck, build, secret scan, chain consistency and\nevery release verifier pass. The MySQL migration job was not run here,\nfor want of a container runtime.\n\ndocs/STATUS.md gains evidence only. No status value moves: all eleven CH\nrows stay IMPLEMENTED-NOT-VERIFIED.","tree":{"sha":"21ea527a7f9241026e2bd086ae70ae11f8acb62d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GiraffeTechnology/ArtFi/git/trees/21ea527a7f9241026e2bd086ae70ae11f8acb62d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GiraffeTechnology/ArtFi/git/commits/8af87e8c3e3d41ae5d4c6cb0345fb25c342aca0f","verification":{"payload":"tree 21ea527a7f9241026e2bd086ae70ae11f8acb62d\nparent f7d41b92122c0f99908abe80e64233a66a816acf\nparent dc6452b0e5578e882961d0350eb1d0b82354a672\nauthor Michael <abcdyi2021@gmail.com> 1790405356 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790405356 +0800\n\nMerge pull request #126: charity delivery, whole-artwork and fractions signature settlement\n\nCharity: PRD.md §7.0''s test-asset markers now render on both charity\nsurfaces, are required in a test-payload batch manifest and forbidden in\nthe real batch''s, and are carried in the Hoodi deployment record. The\nrelease verifier could not have accepted a Hoodi package at all, so step\nI of the Hoodi plan could not have passed at any point; all three gates\nnow branch on §7.0''s two payloads, each branch enforcing isolation rather\nthan relaxing it.\n\nWhole artwork: WholeArtworkMarket.sol adds the ArtFi settlement leg the\nline never had. The seller signs an EIP-712 intent off chain, nothing\ngoes on chain until a fill, and fillIntent moves payment and artwork\natomically with the contract on neither side.\n\nFractions: ArtFiMarket''s fixed-price path now settles by signature with\ncumulative partial fills, as PRD.md §4.2.2 ruled on 2026-08-30. Escrow\nis retained for auctions, which the same ruling keeps.\n\nMerged on local evidence. The quality workflow could not execute on this\nhead: all five jobs failed in two seconds with no runner assigned and no\nsteps recorded, on the first run and again on one re-run. That is the\ninfrastructure failure AGENTS.md already documents twice, not a result\nabout this code, and it affects every pull request rather than this one.\nLocally: forge 135 pass, vitest 125 pass, playwright 118 pass with 2\nskips across desktop and mobile, go vet and gofmt and go test -race pass,\nand format, lint, typecheck, build, secret scan, chain consistency and\nevery release verifier pass. The MySQL migration job was not run here,\nfor want of a container runtime.\n\ndocs/STATUS.md gains evidence only. No status value moves: all eleven CH\nrows stay IMPLEMENTED-NOT-VERIFIED.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt2rsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXgoQAIVrA1VA3DzkGDvEnEFlSWWU\nfQHwaQ4apOB/PKxpqCKxx1eDCC9kw8KtX9OaHeUXfnXPJVDh6l7L3j+Ly8OnY6Gw\nC6fzX6AXdVEheQep0nwP5gkTWvliInWyv3WIPHOw5BXTMMdnSns6Hf98ndgSmO08\n0xkJxZ1CMdp/rf1nvInXcC6WIxAtjlEVkiAZgQh5Jth40FoAJPLU6hgX49g5Ib4L\nWp2eQHYBVcCWdv2HNa2aE2q/V9QGasI6XQ50E4kIRah7PoEgsy+u2cPUPN4V0uuB\nZlYEsRf2YbF10XvECQATX98QDQljezRMBZJUHg3pwkYZ/dGa0TWvs1FQzveHtApl\nebMQQHEAhQfKFC2VNUHUN0Pz2kRi+ZNmD/1VSfNLhI1e2BClMBWCAuEo5L6GpfrR\nS2gsvkHk997rYgon2WSlVyIpfmrRjCKVRaAHoYQfSM2P79RwdlOy2xqfHLVilG/2\nd4cCA+SHlb5pEWNRy+Dlg+EiyXKih7Li7kq5swPMipXfgd2jgunZz0s/O1rxnBkm\nyA+GhRSBwDYv/LmDAqNBAJsaoJ88cCNS1tQrWKMgu4R4fq3sJX2arjQV1Y2zcEyk\noIranKGHWwfV0m9y4unO+B8oUGLGcsD6xXZYm/XBhladxsykd0K4vskSr0aytG0d\n6XMF70LKxLT0e69OdW39\n=iw6n\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE