ps://github.com/GiraffeTechnology/ArtFi/commit/cd709dda384ea2667432dbd4a15de34c7d918f63","sha":"cd709dda384ea2667432dbd4a15de34c7d918f63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GiraffeTechnology/ArtFi/commits/cd709dda384ea2667432dbd4a15de34c7d918f63"}],"sha":"eafe45f0dbe0d2e75ebd2d3f2896962532a08384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GiraffeTechnology/ArtFi/commits/eafe45f0dbe0d2e75ebd2d3f2896962532a08384"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GiraffeTechnology/ArtFi/commits/cd709dda384ea2667432dbd4a15de34c7d918f63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:34:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:34:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Merge codex/vendor-neutral-operations-20260919 (PR #115)\n\n`docs/STATUS.md` was the only conflict, and git reported it as binary\nbecause **that branch carries a corrupted copy of the file.**\n\nChecked at the blob level rather than guessed. `docs/STATUS.md` starts\nwith binary garbage at `7fa8e14`, the point #115 forked from, and is\nstill corrupted at the #115 tip. The r2 branch later repaired it, so\n#114''s tip is clean. Merging #115''s version as-is would have\nreintroduced the damage.\n\nResolved by keeping the clean file and transplanting the section #115\nactually adds — its dated neutral-operations-host-role entry — so none of\nthat work is lost. The result is valid UTF-8 and carries all four\ncontributions: this branch''s charity and M1/M2 evidence, #114''s XM rows,\n#115''s entry, and the fixture-disclosure entry.\n\n**#115 should repair `docs/STATUS.md` on its own branch too.** This merge\nfixes the file here; it does not fix it there, and anything else merging\nfrom that branch would hit the same corruption.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CpdXJvic82vY3nEZSQH8JE","tree":{"sha":"c212b4834bfe04cce7d2d9c2604c8523f5f0495b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GiraffeTechnology/ArtFi/git/trees/c212b4834bfe04cce7d2d9c2604c8523f5f0495b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GiraffeTechnology/ArtFi/git/commits/cd709dda384ea2667432dbd4a15de34c7d918f63","verification":{"payload":"tree c212b4834bfe04cce7d2d9c2604c8523f5f0495b\nparent ae6870235e7439265dfdc43071cf8c2da54a177a\nparent 9288ce0911c30bb70ec73172f04606d73ac72f74\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790364864 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790364864 +0000\n\nMerge codex/vendor-neutral-operations-20260919 (PR #115)\n\n`docs/STATUS.md` was the only conflict, and git reported it as binary\nbecause **that branch carries a corrupted copy of the file.**\n\nChecked at the blob level rather than guessed. `docs/STATUS.md` starts\nwith binary garbage at `7fa8e14`, the point #115 forked from, and is\nstill corrupted at the #115 tip. The r2 branch later repaired it, so\n#114''s tip is clean. Merging #115''s version as-is would have\nreintroduced the damage.\n\nResolved by keeping the clean file and transplanting the section #115\nactually adds — its dated neutral-operations-host-role entry — so none of\nthat work is lost. The result is valid UTF-8 and carries all four\ncontributions: this branch''s charity and M1/M2 evidence, #114''s XM rows,\n#115''s entry, and the fixture-disclosure entry.\n\n**#115 should repair `docs/STATUS.md` on its own branch too.** This merge\nfixes the file here; it does not fix it there, and anything else merging\nfrom that branch would hit the same corruption.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CpdXJvic82vY3nEZSQH8JE\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEU27xgH\n4H2R5yW2BQBmwSBEqeL9hkA5Mfrgf7u38yUmZ31nZHKApbsgtEc8wUNQ9QU/5N7Qq9Y444bGjDef\nqQM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T19:42:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/GiraffeTechnology/ArtFi/commit/cd709dda384ea2667432dbd4a15de34c7d918f63","node_id":"C_kwDOT