l":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commit/57ed894bd6dd81009975932d7e667f72eaab2c73","node_id":"C_kwDOT8yoE9oAKDU3ZWQ4OTRiZDZkZDgxMDA5OTc1OTMyZDdlNjY3ZjcyZWFhYjJjNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commit/16293e5b30cd6495e4439a368042651bd11c1642","sha":"16293e5b30cd6495e4439a368042651bd11c1642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commits/16293e5b30cd6495e4439a368042651bd11c1642"}],"sha":"57ed894bd6dd81009975932d7e667f72eaab2c73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commits/57ed894bd6dd81009975932d7e667f72eaab2c73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47120265?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22","id":47120265,"login":"mherman22","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTIwMjY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commits/16293e5b30cd6495e4439a368042651bd11c1642/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T12:04:55Z","email":"hermanmuhereza22@gmail.com","name":"mherman22"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T12:05:38Z","email":"hermanmuhereza22@gmail.com","name":"mherman22"},"message":"Content-address the lazy chunks\n\nReported from a browser: the patient picker died in LOADING_SOURCE_CODE with\n`__webpack_modules__[e] is undefined`, while an EHR launch into the same module worked and a fresh\nbrowser was fine.\n\nrspack names lazy chunks `[id].js` -- 117.js, 163.js -- and nothing else in their URL moves either: this\nmodule is not published, so its version stays 1.0.0 and it is always served from\n`uwdigi-esm-smart-app-launch-app-1.0.0/`. So a chunk URL means whatever the last build put there. A\nbrowser holding 117.js from an earlier build serves it beside a current entry file, the module ids\ndisagree, and the chunk that only the picker route loads is exactly the one least likely to have been\nre-fetched since.\n\nThe distribution''s nginx already revalidates this module for that reason, but a cache header cannot\nretract a response the browser stored months ago under `expires 1y`. Only a different URL can, so the\ncontent hash goes in the name.\n\nAlso adds the test that was missing. It does not reproduce the failure -- a test context has no cache --\nbut nothing covered signing out of the application and starting again, which is where this was reported,\nand it asserts the picker rendered rather than that its URL was reached.","tree":{"sha":"66720022837aa9336376ccda9b68268830b2c8ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/git/trees/66720022837aa9336376ccda9b68268830b2c8ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/git/commits/16293e5b30cd6495e4439a368042651bd11c1642","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47120265?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22","id":47120265,"login":"mherman22","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTIwMjY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commit/16293e5b30cd6495e4439a368042651bd11c1642","node_id":"C_kwDOT8yoE9oAKDE2MjkzZTViMzBjZDY0OTVlNDQzOWEzNjgwNDI2NTFiZDExYzE2NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commit/de99bbf7340901bd5064f28a9d0a45522d8ab3e3","sha":"de99bbf7340901bd5064f28a9d0a45522d8ab3e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commits/de99bbf7340901bd5064f28a9d0a45522d8ab3e3"}],"sha":"16293e5b30cd6495e4439a368042651bd11c1642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commits/16293e5b30cd6495e4439a368042651bd11c1642"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47120265?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22","id":47120265,"login":"mherman22","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTIwMjY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commits/de99bbf7340901bd5064f28a9d0a45522d8ab3e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T10:14:44Z","email":"hermanmuhereza22@gmail.com","name":"mherman22"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T10:14:44Z","email":"hermanmuhereza22@gmail.com","name":"mherman22"},"message":"Stop capturing the discovery document twice\n\nIt lives under the FHIR base, so removing it from the interesting-paths list did not stop the passive\ncapture picking it up: `/ws/fhir2/R4/` matches it too. The spec also fetches it deliberately, and\nwhichever of the two won the de-duplication decided whether the committed walkthrough said\n`Accept: */*` or `Accept: application/json` -- the last thing that made a capture run rewrite\ndocumentation that had not changed.","tree":{"sha":"468edc2ad9bf6c6e1772fff37a3eea18d16bdf62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/git/trees/468edc2ad9bf6c6e1772fff37a3eea18d16bdf62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/git/commits/de99bbf7340901bd5064f28a9d0a45522d8ab3e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47120265?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22","id":47120265,"login":"mherman22","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTIwMjY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commit/de99bbf7340901bd5064f28a9d0a45522d8ab3e3","node_id":"C_kwDOT8yoE9oAKGRlOTliYmY3MzQwOTAxYmQ1MDY0ZjI4YTlkMGE0NTUyMmQ4YWIzZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commit/0a8776d194d9f8139e640c4fe367b2f6a86c37ae","sha":"0a8776d194d9f8139e640c4fe367b2f6a86c37ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commits/0a8776d194d9f8139e640c4fe367b2f6a86c37ae"}],"sha":"de99bbf7340901bd5064f28a9d0a45522d8ab3e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commits/de99bbf7340901bd5064f28a9d0a45522d8ab3e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47120265?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22","id":47120265,"login":"mherman22","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTIwMjY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/commits/0a8776d194d9f8139e640c4fe367b2f6a86c37ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T09:40:13Z","email":"hermanmuhereza22@gmail.com","name":"mherman22"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T09:40:13Z","email":"hermanmuhereza22@gmail.com","name":"mherman22"},"message":"Capture the request and response of every hop\n\nThe walkthroughs in the distribution showed a screenshot per step and a list of redirect URLs. That says\nwhere the browser went, not what was said -- not the form the token request posts, not that the token\nresponse carries `patient`, not which scopes came back, not that the launched application''s FHIR reads\ncarry a bearer token where the chart''s carry a cookie. Those are the parts someone integrating has to\nreproduce, and prose describing them drifts from the code the moment either changes.\n\ne2e/wire.ts records the exchanges a launch makes and writes them between `<!-- wire:name -->` markers in\nthe step docs, so the evidence is generated and the prose around it stays hand-written. Both specs use\nit: the EHR walkthrough for the launch, the authorize hop, the vouching hop, the token exchange and the\napplication''s reads, and the standalone launch for the patient-selection detour and its own token\nexchange, which happens outside the browser and so is handed over directly.\n\nGrouping is by endpoint rather than by timing, because most of a launch is server-side 302s the browser\ncommits as one navigation, and a step label applied when a response happens to arrive put the token\nexchange under whichever step was running.\n\nEverything is redacted: launch handles, authorization codes, PKCE verifiers and challenges, session\ncodes, Keycloak action tokens, and any JWT. Three signed tokens reached the committed documentation\nbefore the JWT rule stopped requiring a word boundary -- these arrive URL-encoded as `key%3DeyJ...`, and\n`%3D` ends in a word character.\n\nRe-running rewrites nothing that has not changed. A searchset''s Bundle id and search timestamp are\nreplaced, and where a response body could not be read -- reading one races with the page that asked for\nit being torn down -- a copy that has the body wins over one that does not.","tree":{"sha":"0ffd9793c88e10d10ffeac19d226fc65f071d557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/git/trees/0ffd9793c88e10d10ffeac19d226fc65f071d557"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mherman22/openmrs-esm-smart-app-launch-app/git/commits/0a8776d194d9f8139e640c4fe367b2f6a86c37ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47120265?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mherman22","id":47120265,"login":"mherman22","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTIwMjY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mherman22/repos","site_