ation state.\n- Create NotificationContext for handling notifications across the application.\n- Implement RemoteBoundary for error handling in remote microfrontends.\n- Add loaders for lazy loading microfrontends (Vacancies, Candidates, Interviews).\n- Define remote module contracts in remotes.d.ts for microfrontends.\n- Set up basic CSS styles for the application layout.\n- Create AppLayout component to structure the main application layout.\n- Implement Sidebar and TopNav components for navigation.\n- Configure navigation items based on user roles.\n- Develop pages for Admin, Candidates, Dashboard, Interviews, Login, NotFound, and Vacancies.\n- Set up TypeScript configuration for the application.\n- Configure Vite for building and serving the application with Module Federation.","tree":{"sha":"27d6434a094d076498202964c5428cafa465f180","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mauricioPallares/frontend-poli/git/trees/27d6434a094d076498202964c5428cafa465f180"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mauricioPallares/frontend-poli/git/commits/de41d597a6b699d3584d94f837ef69bae5efcec5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232692320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciovillamizar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciovillamizar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciovillamizar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciovillamizar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mauriciovillamizar","id":232692320,"login":"mauriciovillamizar","node_id":"U_kgDODd6aYA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciovillamizar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciovillamizar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mauriciovillamizar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_ur