7:22:59Z","email":"abmishra700@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Mishra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T07:22:59Z","email":"abmishra700@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Mishra"},"message":"v0.6.0 — name the left-hand pin methods after their edge\n\ngetPinCount / getMaxPinCount / setPinCount said nothing about which edge\nthey controlled, which only became confusing once getRightPinCount and\nfriends existed beside them. They are now getLeftPinCount /\ngetMaxLeftPinCount / setLeftPinCount, matching the right-hand three.\n\nThe old names still work — they are aliases of the left-hand methods — so\nnothing breaks on upgrade.\n\nAlso fixes \"viewpoft-capped\" in three comments and doc lines: the 0.1.0\nrename of the CSS class prefix (rt- to ft-) was a blind substring replace\nand caught the \"rt-\" inside \"viewport-capped\" as well. No other word in\nthe package was affected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8306c42be1d0bae585a8df85a6013604944c53a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhimishra2424/freeze-table/git/trees/e8306c42be1d0bae585a8df85a6013604944c53a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhimishra2424/freeze-table/git/commits/e1dd085fb843a5feb221253871ac1a46dbeec357","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47156246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhimishra2424","id":47156246,"login":"Abhimishra2424","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU2MjQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhimishra2424/freeze-table/commit/e1dd085fb843a5feb221253871ac1a46dbeec357","node_id":"C_kwDOT9Ec4doAKGUxZGQwODVmYjg0M2E1ZmViMjIxMjUzODcxYWMxYTQ2ZGJlZWMzNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Abhimishra2424/freeze-table/commit/0c77134c26f20ae096849650415de9059c419f50","sha":"0c77134c26f20ae096849650415de9059c419f50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhimishra2424/freeze-table/commits/0c77134c26f20ae096849650415de9059c419f50"}],"sha":"e1dd085fb843a5feb221253871ac1a46dbeec357","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhimishra2424/freeze-table/commits/e1dd085fb843a5feb221253871ac1a46dbeec357"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47156246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhimishra2424","id":47156246,"login":"Abhimishra2424","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU2MjQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhimishra2424/freeze-table/commits/0c77134c26f20ae096849650415de9059c419f50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:32:08Z","email":"abmishra700@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Mishra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:32:08Z","email":"abmishra700@gmail.com","name":"Abhishek Mishra"},"message":"v0.5.0 — pinActions: freeze just the Action column\n\nThe Action column only froze as a passenger of the right-hand block, so\nkeeping a row''s controls reachable meant pinning a data column you did not\nwant pinned. That is backwards: reaching the actions without scrolling\nback is the commonest reason to freeze anything on the right at all.\n\n`pinActions` freezes it on its own, with rightPinCount left at 0. It still\njoins the block automatically when rightPinCount > 0, so nothing changes\nfor callers already pinning data columns.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77b2b9d6e88c0524f31b918aeb03467f68353d01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhimishra2424/freeze-table/git/trees/77b2b9d6e88c0524f31b918aeb03467f68353d01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhimishra2424/freeze-table/git/commits/0c77134c26f20ae096849650415de9059c419f50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47156246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra2424/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhimishra2424","id":47156246,"login":"Abhimishra2424","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTU2MjQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abhimishra