eOfSamson","id":189968849,"login":"codeOfSamson","node_id":"U_kgDOC1Kx0Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeOfSamson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeOfSamson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeOfSamson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeOfSamson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeOfSamson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codeOfSamson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeOfSamson/shopifyDemoApp/commits/034a7697045ad1fc1f8c8f03a13123ed2d3f5926/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T10:20:08Z","email":"samflavin981@gmail.com","name":"Sam Flavin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T10:20:08Z","email":"samflavin981@gmail.com","name":"Sam Flavin"},"message":"Add Playwright e2e coverage for cart and inventory flows\n\nwebServer readiness for `web` now probes /cart instead of / (apps/web\nhas no page at the root, so the default probe 404s forever and the\nsuite never boots). cart.spec.ts waits for the add-to-cart server\naction''s response before navigating to /cart, since the click resolves\nbefore the useTransition-wrapped action finishes and the assertion\nwould otherwise race the cartId cookie write.\n\nReal run against the connected dev store: cart.spec.ts passes (product\n\"shoes\" exists, full add-to-cart -> view-cart flow works).\ninventory.spec.ts''s two tests fail as expected — apps/inventory-ops has\nno Admin API token configured yet, so /inventory renders the\n\"Connect your Shopify Admin API token\" card instead of the table.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013HwZfnv3NZYtkksYdiezJN","tree":{"sha":"5ef663aa9227573d3dcfd75d8a65e5547f892780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codeOfSamson/shopifyDemoApp/git/trees/5ef663aa9227573d3dcfd75d