name":"Dmitry Popov"},"message":"Name what the layout notes refer to instead of a plan identifier\n\nThe docblock referred to phases of an internal delivery plan. A reader outside\nthe project cannot look any of those up, and each was standing in for something\nwith a perfectly good name -- the parser, the verify-spine fixture, the default\nsizes, the designer page.\n\nThe reasoning around them is worth publishing; only the identifiers were not.\nFound by the publish guard, which reads every file a push touches, so a two-line\nchange brought the whole docblock into scope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"96ed44f120bec077f202cc705e3e6b0f2615d937","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/git/trees/96ed44f120bec077f202cc705e3e6b0f2615d937"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/git/commits/e60d38e846cf8657c82a30bacba0f9304cc7b2f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7189630?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thugstar","id":7189630,"login":"thugstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODk2MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/coolms/designe