"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/coolms/designer/commit/5de31ff11f438c654f5cfc7e81d25eb599fc9a69","node_id":"C_kwDOT9ZoF9oAKDVkZTMxZmYxMWY0MzhjNjU0ZjVjZmM3ZTgxZDI1ZWI1OTlmYzlhNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/coolms/designer/commit/9b3264e6059dada6373a12bf509a3586dbeabf63","sha":"9b3264e6059dada6373a12bf509a3586dbeabf63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/commits/9b3264e6059dada6373a12bf509a3586dbeabf63"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/coolms/designer/commit/92596e486271b242113101860479b7b6c263a72c","sha":"92596e486271b242113101860479b7b6c263a72c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/commits/92596e486271b242113101860479b7b6c263a72c"}],"sha":"5de31ff11f438c654f5cfc7e81d25eb599fc9a69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/commits/5de31ff11f438c654f5cfc7e81d25eb599fc9a69"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7189630?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thugstar","id":7189630,"login":"thugstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODk2MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/commits/92596e486271b242113101860479b7b6c263a72c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:23:03Z","email":"d.popov@altgraphic.com","name":"Dmitry Popov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:23:03Z","email":"d.popov@altgraphic.com","name":"Dmitry Popov"},"message":"Remove internal milestone identifiers from comments and test names\n\nThe package was developed inside a private application, and its\ncomments carried the application''s internal milestone identifiers --\nlabels of the form \"M<major>.<minor>.<slice>\" naming planning slices.\nThree hundred and seventy-two of them, across ninety files, including\none that rendered to end users in the canvas banner.\n\nThey fail exactly the test the publish guard applies to a\ndecision-record id: a reader outside the project cannot look them up,\nand they expose the shape of a private plan. They also aged badly --\nmost sat inside forward-looking sentences (\"lands in ...\", \"deferred\nto ...\") describing work that has since shipped, so the surrounding\nprose was not merely opaque but wrong.\n\nTwo kinds, translated rather than stripped:\n\n  - References to backend engine slices became descriptions of the\n    component (\"the engine parser\", \"the engine validator\"), which is\n    what a reader actually needs.\n  - References to this package''s own slices are gone, and the stale\n    roadmap paragraphs around them with them.\n\nAlso repairs the sentence fragments an earlier automated attempt left\nbehind, and corrects two docblocks that still described the palette\nhost as living on the Sidebar after it moved to the Toolbar.\n\nNo behaviour change: 951 tests, typecheck and build all pass.","tree":{"sha":"e393d49c6279f022ce83859904af871059a0b480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/git/trees/e393d49c6279f022ce83859904af871059a0b480"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/git/commits/92596e486271b242113101860479b7b6c263a72c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7189630?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thugstar","id":7189630,"login":"thugstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODk2MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/coolms/designer/commit/92596e486271b242113101860479b7b6c263a72c","node_id":"C_kwDOT9ZoF9oAKDkyNTk2ZTQ4NjI3MWIyNDIxMTMxMDE4NjA0NzliN2I2YzI2M2E3MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/coolms/designer/commit/9b3264e6059dada6373a12bf509a3586dbeabf63","sha":"9b3264e6059dada6373a12bf509a3586dbeabf63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/commits/9b3264e6059dada6373a12bf509a3586dbeabf63"}],"sha":"92596e486271b242113101860479b7b6c263a72c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/commits/92596e486271b242113101860479b7b6c263a72c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7189630?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thugstar","id":7189630,"login":"thugstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODk2MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/commits/9b3264e6059dada6373a12bf509a3586dbeabf63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T10:45:20Z","email":"d.popov@altgraphic.com","name":"Dmitry Popov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T10:50:04Z","email":"d.popov@altgraphic.com","name":"Dmitry Popov"},"message":"Initial public release of @coolms/designer (0.1.0-alpha.1)\n\nFramework-agnostic, zero-dependency visual designer for BPMN-Lite\nprocesses, DMN decision tables, DMN decision requirement diagrams, and\nSymfony Workflow state machines.\n\nOne entry point -- createEditor(host, {surface}) -- over a shared SVG\ncanvas, shell and property-panel substrate. The editors share\nmodule-level registries, so a single entry point is a correctness\nproperty, not just API taste: offering per-surface bundles as well\nwould hand a consumer two copies of that state.\n\nWritten from scratch rather than assembled from general-purpose\nmodelers: a full BPMN 2.0 palette can draw elements a deliberate engine\nsubset will reject, driving one means keeping a moddle XML model and\nthe engine''s own JSON honest with each other, and cross-surface\nreferences (a service task pointing at a decision) have nowhere to live\nwhen the editors are separate packages.\n\n951 unit tests. MIT.","tree":{"sha":"b83fcb533c7dcc348ee1a576df64d982c1ab3b2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/git/trees/b83fcb533c7dcc348ee1a576df64d982c1ab3b2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/git/commits/9b3264e6059dada6373a12bf509a3586dbeabf63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7189630?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thugstar","id":7189630,"login":"thugstar","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODk2MzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thugstar","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/coolms/designer/commit/9b3264e6059dada6373a12bf509a3586dbeabf63","node_id":"C_kwDOT9ZoF9oAKDliMzI2NGU2MDU5ZGFkYTYzNzNhMTJiZjUwOWEzNTg2ZGJlYWJmNjM","parents":[],"sha":"9b3264e6059dada6373a12bf509a3586dbeabf63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/commits/9b3264e6059dada6373a12bf509a3586dbeabf63"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/coolms/designer/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=5aad5e2348fd23ac7253d2fd9e52dd844a1ceac9&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A19%3A35.172Z"}');
