,{"author":{"account":{"login":"anthonidev","providerType":"User"},"email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-19T07:13:44Z","committedDate":"2026-08-19T07:13:44Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"anthonidev","providerType":"User"},"email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:17:01.251Z","repositoryId":1339651463,"sha":"a5afc427da9a6f957da9079567e4f75fb278f693"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:17:01.251Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/2dda81a45d72f7e5cc2784beee06c04d3b867580/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T17:56:50Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T17:56:50Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"feat: UI polish pass — nav, detail navigation, theme animation, caching\n\n- AppLayout: brand (\"Atlantic City · Pokédex\") is now a link to home, with\n  a hand-drawn pokéball icon (PokeballIcon.tsx) next to it; \"Home\" nav\n  label changed to \"Inicio\" (desktop nav + mobile bottom nav aria-label).\n- PokemonGridCard: softer hover lift (y:-6/scale:1.03 -> y:-3/scale:1.015)\n  and a small \"greeting wiggle\" (scale + rotate keyframes) on the sprite\n  itself on hover, layered on top of the card''s own hover.\n- Detail page: \"Volver al inicio\" button next to the prev/next chevrons\n  (new onGoHome prop threaded Shell -> PokemonDetail -> PokemonDetailContent,\n  same router-free pattern as onNavigate — see docs/adr/003), plus\n  ArrowLeft/ArrowRight keyboard navigation mirroring the chevrons (ignores\n  the event with a modifier held, so it doesn''t fight the browser''s own\n  back/forward gesture). Restructured the hero''s top row to a 3-column\n  grid so the #id badge stays centered regardless of what''s in the left\n  cell. Updated remotes.d.ts, which still had the old PokemonDetail prop\n  signature.\n- ThemeToggle: circular \"reveal\" animation via document.startViewTransition\n  + a manually-animated clip-path on ::view-transition-new(root), expanding\n  from wherever the button was clicked. Falls back to an instant toggle\n  where View Transitions isn''t supported.\n- Shell + MF1 QueryClients: staleTime/gcTime set to Infinity — PokeAPI data\n  is static, so cached responses never need to be treated as stale or\n  evicted while the tab is open. Dropped the now-redundant per-query\n  staleTime override on SearchModal''s names query.\n- README: live Vercel URLs (shell/mf1-detail/mf2-history, renamed to\n  cleaner project names), a note that changing the Shell''s env vars needs\n  a Redeploy (not just saving the variable) since Module Federation bakes\n  the remote URLs in at build time.","tree":{"sha":"e3ff90cffdadc4818c8773623fe6ceacae4aee8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/trees/e3ff90cffdadc4818c8773623fe6ceacae4aee8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/commits/2dda81a45d72f7e5cc2784beee06c04d3b867580","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/2dda81a45d72f7e5cc2784beee06c04d3b867580","node_id":"C_kwDOT9l1h9oAKDJkZGE4MWE0NWQ3MmY3ZTVjYzI3ODRiZWVlMDZjMDRkM2I4Njc1ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/9a85278bf19c01bbe1ea1ea2095f42e29832dcea","sha":"9a85278bf19c01bbe1ea1ea2095f42e29832dcea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/9a85278bf19c01bbe1ea1ea2095f42e29832dcea"}],"sha":"2dda81a45d72f7e5cc2784beee06c04d3b867580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/2dda81a45d72f7e5cc2784beee06c04d3b867580"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/9a85278bf19c01bbe1ea1ea2095f42e29832dcea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T17:22:43Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T17:22:43Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"feat: pokéball favicon + per-route document titles\n\n- Replaced the default Vite favicon.svg in all 3 apps with a hand-drawn\n  pokéball (plain SVG shapes, no external asset).\n- Static <title> in each index.html no longer says \"shell\"/\"mf1-detail\"/\n  \"mf2-history\" (Vite scaffold defaults).\n- New useDocumentTitle hook (apps/shell): sets document.title per route,\n  restoring the base title on unmount. Wired into Login (\"Iniciar\n  sesión\"), History (\"Historial\"), and the Pokémon detail page (the\n  route param itself, e.g. \"Mewtwo\" — the real display name lives inside\n  MF1''s own fetch, not available at the Shell level).","tree":{"sha":"743075c128758f4a49a165d92bed2ed14ae4a49c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/trees/743075c128758f4a49a165d92bed2ed14ae4a49c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/c