g_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/93dd424b1630c0b2d03f906af8af2616702370be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T17:19:05Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T17:19:05Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"fix: reload toast stuck open after logout; polish login + README\n\n- UserMenu: logout now calls toast.dismiss() before clearing the\n  session. The Toaster lives at the app root (outside AppLayout) so it\n  survives route changes — VisitToastListener unmounting on logout never\n  dismissed whatever toast it had already shown, so \"último visitado\"\n  stayed on screen through the redirect to /login.\n- LoginPage: bigger card (max-w-sm -> max-w-md, more padding), larger\n  title/icon, and a footer with author name, email, and repo link.\n- README: tech stack badges up top, a live-demo badge linking to the\n  Vercel deploy, and an Autor section (name, email, GitHub, repo).","tree":{"sha":"9fc413475316e7384dec1a1c941185445bb56d75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/trees/9fc413475316e7384dec1a1c941185445bb56d75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/commits/93dd424b1630c0b2d03f906af8af2616702370be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/93dd424b1630c0b2d03f906af8af2616702370be","node_id":"C_kwDOT9l1h9oAKDkzZGQ0MjRiMTYzMGMwYjJkMDNmOTA2YWY4YWYyNjE2NzAyMzcwYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/365d8819704a784a58fac60033cbb3656c3757b8","sha":"365d8819704a784a58fac60033cbb3656c3757b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/365d8819704a784a58fac60033cbb3656c3757b8"}],"sha":"93dd424b1630c0b2d03f906af8af2616702370be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/93dd424b1630c0b2d03f906af8af2616702370be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/365d8819704a784a58fac60033cbb3656c3757b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T16:57:28Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T16:57:28Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"fix: entire Shell UI stuck rendering \"mobile\" at any viewport in production\n\nAfter the previous fix, a new bug: the desktop header (nav, search button,\nuser menu) stayed hidden and the mobile bottom nav stayed visible\nregardless of actual window width. Invisible in `pnpm dev` again.\n\nRuled out (with evidence, not guesses) before finding the real cause:\nwindow.innerWidth/matchMedia both reported the viewport correctly, it\nwasn''t browser cache (cleared via CDP before every check), and it wasn''t\nVite''s CSS minifier (tested cssMinify: false in isolation — same bug,\nan earlier \"fix\" only looked like it worked because that test happened to\nnot have MF1 loaded at all).\n\nRoot cause, confirmed by walking document.styleSheets with full support\nfor nested @layer/@media/@supports (not just eyeballing the \"obvious\"\nrule — you have to see which one actually wins): Shell and each remote\ncompile their own independent Tailwind v4 CSS, each with its own `@layer\nutilities { ... }`. Browsers merge same-named layers across different\nstylesheets — so once a remote''s CSS is also injected into the document\n(bundleAllCSS: true), its own duplicate, unconditional `.flex` utility\nends up positioned after Shell''s `.sm\\:hidden` in the merged cascade, and\nwins at equal specificity. Shell''s own responsive intent gets buried by\nan unrelated base class from a completely different bundle.\n\nFix: bundleAllCSS: false on both remotes. Shell''s index.css already\n`@source`-scans MF1/MF2''s source (from the very first CSS bug, see\nADR 002) and is a strict superset of every class they use — it never\nneeded the remotes'' own CSS injected at all. That first fix already made\nthis flag redundant; nobody noticed until both were live at once in\nproduction. Verified with `vite preview` on separate ports (same\ncross-origin shape as Vercel): header/mobile-nav now switch correctly by\nviewport on Home/Detail/History, and standalone MF1/MF2 (their own\nindex.html, unrelated to this mechanism) render unaffected.\n\nFull diagnosis in docs/adr/002.","tree":{"sha":"8dd9ba71c96635737235770914feb7906dd41712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/trees/8dd9ba71c96635737235770914feb7906dd41712"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/commits/365d8819704a784a58fac60033cbb3656c3757b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/365d8819704a784a58fac60033cbb3656c3757b8","node_id":"C_kwDOT9l1h9oAKDM2NWQ4ODE5NzA0YTc4NGE1OGZhYzYwMDMzY2JiMzY1NmMzNzU3Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/ccfd33c5e19eca26a288f36cc46cfbcd688546f2","sha":"ccfd33c5e19eca26a288f36cc46cfbcd688546f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/ccfd33c5e19eca26a288f36cc46cfbcd688546f2"}],"sha":"365d8819704a784a58fac60033cbb3656c3757b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/365d8819704a784a58fac60033cbb3656c3757b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/ccfd33c5e19eca26a288f36cc46cfbcd688546f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T16:31:12Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T16:31:12Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"fix: detail/history stuck on skeleton forever in production\n\nReact.lazy() + Suspense never noticed a remote module had resolved once\nShell and the remotes were on separate origins (any real deploy, Vercel\nincluded) — no error, just permanently suspended, invisible in `pnpm dev`\nwhere everything shares one Vite server. Verified the federation runtime\nitself resolved the module fine (checked window.__mf_module_cache__\ndirectly); explicitly ruled out the classic duplicate-React-instance\nissue by testing with singleton: true, which changed nothing.\n\nRemoteBoundary now drives the same loader() promise through a plain\nuseEffect + useState instead of lazy/Suspense''s internal \"throw the\npromise during render\" protocol. Needed an explicit .catch() too, since\nRemoteErrorBoundary can''t catch a rejection from inside an effect the way\nit caught lazy()''s thrown errors — re-throws during render instead.\n\nAlso fixed \"Reintentar\" on the error boundary: it only reset React state,\nbut the federation runtime caches a failed remoteEntry.js load at the\nsession level and won''t retry the network request just because React\nasks again. Now does a real window.location.reload().\n\nReproduced and verified locally by serving the 3 production builds with\n`vite preview` on separate ports (same cross-origin shape as Vercel) —\nthis is genuinely undetectable in dev and only showed up after deploying.\nFull diagnosis in docs/adr/002.","tree":{"sha":"4cda38064f3ff0008a7d31c083eda03236fd12c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/trees/4cda38064f3ff0008a7d31c083eda03236fd12c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/commits/ccfd33c5e19eca26a288f36cc46cfbcd688546f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/ccfd33c5e19eca26a288f36cc46cfbcd688546f2","node_id":"C_kwDOT9l1h9oAKGNjZmQzM2M1ZTE5ZWNhMjZhMjg4ZjM2Y2M0NmNmYmNkNjg4NTQ2ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/63cf21a74a06a9406feb32a1e236fe27f7bcc9cb","sha":"63cf21a74a06a9406feb32a1e236fe27f7bcc9cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/63cf21a74a06a9406feb32a1e236fe27f7bcc9cb"}],"sha":"ccfd33c5e19eca26a288f36cc46cfbcd688546f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/ccfd33c5e19eca26a288f36cc46cfbcd688546f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/63cf21a74a06a9406feb32a1e236fe27f7bcc9cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T14:00:16Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T14:00:16Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"chore: ignore .vercel, .playwright-mcp, coverage\n\nAlso removed a stray empty reto_tecnico_frontend_senior/docs/adr\ndirectory nested inside the repo root — untracked, git never saw it.","tree":{"sha":"3c42253f104b77b45a029fc4414780728fc51e9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/trees/3c42253f104b77b45a029fc4414780728fc51e9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/commits/63cf21a74a06a9406feb32a1e236fe27f7bcc9cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"htt