nthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/f0f5939dbdc126c579fc403a480c0f8f86b13279/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T13:49:23Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T13:49:23Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"test: add Vitest + Testing Library across all packages\n\n- vitest.shared.config.ts at the root (jsdom + globals), same pattern as\n  vite.shared.config.ts — each package''s vitest.config.ts spreads it and\n  adds @testing-library/jest-dom/vitest as a setupFile where RTL is used.\n- packages/shared: history-storage (increment/dedupe/persistence/remove/\n  clear, toast dismiss incl. the \"revisit same Pokémon\" edge case) and\n  pokeapi (lowercase exact-match, artwork/flavor-text fallbacks) — 25\n  tests, pure logic, no RTL needed.\n- mf2-history: History.test.tsx — render/count/remove/clear/onViewDetail,\n  no mocks needed since history is 100% localStorage.\n- mf1-detail: StatRadar smoke test + PokemonDetail with mocked fetch,\n  verifying the visit gets registered in history.\n- shell: LoginPage (valid/invalid credentials) and SearchModal (exact\n  match, case-insensitive, \"No encontrado\") with mocked fetch.\n- Added a per-app src/vitest.d.ts (side-effect import of\n  @testing-library/jest-dom/vitest) — tsconfig.app.json''s explicit\n  `types` array meant `tsc -b` didn''t see the jest-dom matcher types even\n  though `vitest run` (no type-checking) passed fine without it.","tree":{"sha":"f9