},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/2fb4959eb0385bd3a95ed8abf21ef8e82e64c42d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T13:49:12Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T13:49:12Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"chore: document a reverted Module Federation singleton hardening attempt\n\nTried switching react/react-dom''s shared config from the [''react'',\n''react-dom''] shorthand (implies singleton: false) to the explicit object\nform with singleton: true. Broke the dev server in\n@module-federation/vite@1.20.7 (blank page, \"Pre-transform error ...\nwithout null bytes\" on the react-dom virtual module). Reverted to the\nshorthand and left a comment explaining why, so it isn''t retried blindly.","tree":{"sha":"097a04ee66bbf0cc5d4b8dc9f4e6a59bb331ebf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/trees/097a04ee66bbf0cc5d4b8dc9f4e6a59bb331ebf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/commits/2fb4959eb0385bd3a95ed8abf21ef8e82e64c42d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/2fb4959eb0385bd3a95ed8abf21ef8e82e64c42d","node_id":"C_kwDOT9l1h9oAKDJmYjQ5NTllYjAzODViZDNhOTVlZDhhYmYyMWVmOGU4MmU2NGM0MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/350af090a40af28a238f103ed8d81f44a0b45878","sha":"350af090a40af28a238f103ed8d81f44a0b45878","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/350af090a40af28a238f103ed8d81f44a0b45878"}],"sha":"2fb4959eb0385bd3a95ed8abf21ef8e82e64c42d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/2fb4959eb0385bd3a95ed8abf21ef8e82e64c42d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/350af090a40af28a238f103ed8d81f44a0b45878/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T13:49:07Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T13:49:07Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"fix: search modal double-navigation, broken view transition, and Escape\n\n- SearchModal called navigate() by hand on top of PokemonGridCard''s own\n  <Link>, which also navigates by default — one click pushed 2 history\n  entries, needing two \"back\" presses to leave the detail page. Now the\n  onClick only closes the modal; the Link handles navigation once.\n- PokemonGridCard gets a `viewTransition` prop (default true) so it can be\n  turned off inside the search modal, where the same card is briefly\n  visible both there and in Home''s grid behind it — two elements sharing\n  a viewTransitionName aborted the transition with \"Unexpected duplicate\n  view-transition-name\".\n- Escape didn''t close the search modal: @radix-ui/react-dismissable-layer\n  only wires its Escape listener when it resolves as the \"highest\" layer,\n  which wasn''t happening reliably here. Added an explicit onKeyDown as a\n  guaranteed fallback, plus aria-modal=\"true\" (this Radix version never\n  sets it itself).\n- Removed a stale comment in PokemonDetailPage claiming MF1 bundles its\n  own react-router-dom copy — it has none.","tree":{"sha":"21582cde4ea320be9c24593a3b5af78733ff98c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/trees/21582cde4ea320be9c24593a3b5af78733ff98c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/commits/350af090a40af28a238f103ed8d81f44a0b45878","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/350af090a40af28a238f103ed8d81f44a0b45878","node_id":"C_kwDOT9l1h9oAKDM1MGFmMDkwYTQwYWYyOGEyMzhmMTAzZWQ4ZDgxZjQ0YTBiNDU4Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/ccce4e5681bee55a9b1a1375c7f4959c4fe02a5a","sha":"ccce4e5681bee55a9b1a1375c7f4959c4fe02a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/ccce4e5681bee55a9b1a1375c7f4959c4fe02a5a"}],"sha":"350af090a40af28a238f103ed8d81f44a0b45878","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/350af090a40af28a238f103ed8d81f44a0b45878"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/ccce4e5681bee55a9b1a1375c7f4959c4fe02a5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:17:16Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:17:16Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"fix: History view-transition morph + remote-loading skeleton text\n\nSame two gaps MF1 had:\n\n- onViewDetail already navigated with viewTransition: true, but the\n  card image had no viewTransitionName to pair with the detail page''s\n  hero image, so it only did a generic cross-fade instead of morphing.\n  Added the matching viewTransitionName per entry.\n- RemoteBoundary for /history had no custom fallback, so the raw\n  \"Cargando mf2History/History...\" text showed while the bundle\n  downloaded. Added a skeleton mirroring the real grid layout,\n  in HistoryPage.tsx directly since (unlike MF1) History has no\n  internal data-pending phase of its own to also cover.","tree":{"sha":"07c200be26c7d930360418ce6002039749682050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/trees/07c200be26c7d930360418ce6002039749682050"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/commits/ccce4e5681bee55a9b1a1375c7f4959c4fe02a5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/ccce4e5681bee55a9b1a1375c7f4959c4fe02a5a","node_id":"C_kwDOT9l1h9oAKGNjY2U0ZTU2ODFiZWU1NWE5YjFhMTM3NWM3ZjQ5NTljNGZlMDJhNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/0c728d3a91e476e16dbebc79adba7542cd941465","sha":"0c728d3a91e476e16dbebc79adba7542cd941465","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/0c728d3a91e476e16dbebc79adba7542cd941465"}],"sha":"ccce4e5681bee55a9b1a1375c7f4959c4fe02a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/ccce4e5681bee55a9b1a1375c7f4959c4fe02a5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/0c728d3a91e476e16dbebc79adba7542cd941465/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:08:02Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T12:08:02Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"feat: redesign History (MF2) — grid UI, delete/clear, jump to detail\n\nWas a bare single-column list with no actions. Restyled to match the\nrest of the app (card grid, same tokens/typography as Home/Detail) and\nadded the actions the user asked for:\n\n- Delete a single entry (no confirmation — low risk, easy to redo by\n  revisiting).\n- Clear the whole history, confirmed inline (\"¿Vaciar todo? Sí /\n  Cancelar\" swapped in for the trigger button) instead of a dialog —\n  didn''t want to pull a whole AlertDialog dependency into MF2 for one\n  confirmation, same reasoning as skipping a charting library for the\n  stat radar (ADR 020).\n- Jump to a Pokémon''s detail page. MF2 stays router-free (ADR 003): it\n  takes an optional onViewDetail(name) prop, wired from a new\n  HistoryPage.tsx in the Shell (same pattern as PokemonDetailPage''s\n  prev/next), using viewTransition like the rest of the detail-page\n  navigation. Optional so MF2 still renders standalone on :3002.\n\nAdded removeHistoryEntry/clearHistory to packages/shared''s history\nstorage — clearing the \"last visited\" pointer too when it''s affected,\nso a reload doesn''t toast about a Pokémon no longer in history. Added\nlucide-react to mf2-history for icons (already used in Shell and MF1).","tree":{"sha":"081e41aaeae6d86aa4252c176855b056e6c9b013","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/trees/081e41aaeae6d86aa4252c176855b056e6c9b013"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/commits/0c728d3a91e476e16dbebc79adba7542cd941465","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/0c728d3a91e476e16dbebc79adba7542cd941465","node_id":"C_kwDOT9l1h9oAKDBjNzI4ZDNhOTFlNDc2ZTE2ZGJlYmM3OWFkYmE3NTQyY2Q5NDE0NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commit/5cdd59b1d8e4a367188ec648329d8a0f762e935a","sha":"5cdd59b1d8e4a367188ec648329d8a0f762e935a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/5cdd59b1d8e4a367188ec648329d8a0f762e935a"}],"sha":"0c728d3a91e476e16dbebc79adba7542cd941465","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/0c728d3a91e476e16dbebc79adba7542cd941465"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"anthonidev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTYzMTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/commits/5cdd59b1d8e4a367188ec648329d8a0f762e935a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:57:59Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T11:57:59Z","email":"softwaretoni21@gmail.com","name":"anthonidev"},"message":"fix: raw \"Cargando mf1Detail/...\" text during remote bundle download\n\nThe skeleton added for the data-pending state only covered *after*\nMF1''s own bundle had already loaded — while Module Federation is still\ndownloading that bundle, RemoteBoundary''s Suspense fallback was a\nplain text line, unrelated in shape to the real layout.\n\nMoved the skeleton into packages/shared (PokemonDetailSkeleton) so the\nsame component covers both loading phases: as RemoteBoundary''s\n`fallback` (Shell, while MF1''s bundle downloads) and inside\nPokemonDetailContent itself (MF1, once loaded, while its PokeAPI query\nis pending). No visible seam between the two phases anymore.\nRemoteBoundary''s `fallback` prop is optional per route — MF2/History\nstill uses the generic text since it wasn''t in scope here.","tree":{"sha":"5ac4db7e84905bf72ac8f54817c82308aabd205c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/trees/5ac4db7e84905bf72ac8f54817c82308aabd205c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthonidev/pokedex-microfront/git/commits/5cdd59b1d8e4a367188ec648329d8a0f762e935a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61163166?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthonidev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonidev","id":61163166,"login":"a