ted last — core-package\nextraction + session-based partner auth, then the root-server adoption pitch.\n\nAlso negates the /plans/**/*.md local-only rule for this ticket tree so the\nsprint is reviewed via PR.","tree":{"sha":"715abee40143afe33a12a7cde3fa2f1fce4a4e32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/trees/715abee40143afe33a12a7cde3fa2f1fce4a4e32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/commits/34f76f8b62e1686e08497c64641ecf9ee50692ff","verification":{"payload":"tree 715abee40143afe33a12a7cde3fa2f1fce4a4e32\nparent a56e1da34181619bd109206d795bd7125c110ffc\nauthor Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com> 1790920550 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790920550 -0500\n\ndocs(tickets): deploy-agents-rebuild initiative — 15 tickets (#286)\n\nStream A (01-05): consolidate every deploy path into one bos deploy command\nwith fail-fast preflight, the universal image, and digest-pinned Railway deploys.\nStream B (06-13): vendor the NEAR Agent API domain engine and rebuild the\ncontrol plane as plugins/agents — their standalone server never runs.\nStream C (14-15): upstream convergence proposals, gated last — core-package\nextraction + session-based partner auth, then the root-server adoption pitch.\n\nAlso negates the /plans/**/*.md local-only rule for this ticket tree so the\nsprint is reviewed via PR.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv0dmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAg/8QAArqESlpCSxxbOQJlE9Qk0qA\nOKWm9ZdOffCcPX28KkLmCb1/Nz4b3TuAVzVe3CDchhKPzB52WfbXYBuz5Ys/fJZv\nX6CMISKmOev19v/6QTEwKXCe2+Zj40SCzs0V7/+DcPZd+7qL+wDr99uU+VKQrGPL\n/3YKCsaLZAEIZfFKNlWkGy5Bmi7i3+aaMHeA/AW8guwmtV14DguqbEoR5KaX8sKC\n4xHOsBAOFSI+H/BlFExOMTtx1EmY0rPEh8ffExritxNnYJ9dJKOQkgBLgHCfW6+0\n5pPcBIm2R9/1EZUioMYFb5KepGamzxS7So2fU6DS0ami3PCHRYZcwl8OZ92d5xsu\nfalwJcMPUFuUe3oHgM+fZ/QrP0zjMBIisz8IurYNY4y/W6qUKwbQgpZOmRaoO8zU\n3VMF0A69nnyjD8zIwAT0TiD/BeHh5IQpvBU6JeeG+YadX26Ks9JfsmKFJ1CmBiWZ\nsvqvoqU1jMc+b8ahtpFUVebXIkqQz