ke precheck refuses to stage deposit_and_stake above what the\n  lockup can stake\n\n* fix(ui): address review nits\n\n- drop the implementation comment in team-unstake (repo standard)\n- trim the metadata.name override before prefill\n- rename the prefill merge record for an honest type\n- make the Max-click test exercise the button (clears the field first)","tree":{"sha":"70534e9f34e427db096955ca922cbfdaae297532","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/trees/70534e9f34e427db096955ca922cbfdaae297532"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/commits/cf2ab4d138ed6acedac43b87b3abe3d6b8bdeabb","verification":{"payload":"tree 70534e9f34e427db096955ca922cbfdaae297532\nparent 15aabd6f0e39f1c1e4223de9891ee72bf5a3fc02\nauthor Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com> 1790810364 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790810364 -0500\n\nfeat(ui): run the endowment re-stake from a member session (#285)\n\n* feat(ui): run the endowment re-stake from a member session\n\n- typed endowment treasury input (Trezu connect demoted to secondary)\n- node name prefill uses org metadata.name, and no longer loses the\n  prefill to an empty saved draft (prefill-if-empty after the draft)\n- Endowment chain-state tab shows the lockup''s available-to-stake\n  balance (account balance minus the 2 NEAR storage reserve)\n- Sponsor NEAR gains a Max fill of available minus 1 NEAR; the team\n  unstake/withdraw dialog''s Max fill leaves the same 1 NEAR margin\n- stake precheck refuses to stage deposit_and_stake above what the\n  lockup can stake\n\n* fix(ui): address review nits\n\n- drop the implementation comment in team-unstake (repo standard)\n- trim the metadata.name override before prefill\n- rename the prefill merge record for an honest type\n- make the Max-click test exercise the button (clears the field first)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvZj8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQUMQAJy8oxnr/GxynmlmmlRdbL/P\nlJ