Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:54:06Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"message":"feat(auth): onboarding continuation fixes + /build prompts page\n\nRedeeming an invitation link now activates the invite''s organization even\nwhen the member already redeemed it before; the display-name step is skipped\nfor returning members who already chose a name (synthetic passkey default\nstill prompts). The done panel links to a new /build page holding the two\ncopy-prompt cards (NEAR AI private inference, NEAR Intents), and the\n\"Continue on your computer\" card now points at a direct\n/login?method=phone deep link with concrete scan-and-approve instructions\nplus a copy-link action; the login page opens the pairing QR immediately\nfrom ?method=phone (desktop only).","tree":{"sha":"ccbd5c939f3e44bd4fa7b5e5149fee628370089e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/trees/ccbd5c939f3e44bd4fa7b5e5149fee628370089e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/commits/1c52a7fe16f41cbcc9ac793bcddf013306b0464f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16282460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commit/1c52a7fe16f41cbcc9ac793bcddf013306b0464f","node_id":"C_kwDOT-K1MdoAKDFjNTJhN2ZlMTZmNDFjYmNjOWFjNzkzYmNkZGYwMTMzMDZiMDQ2NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commit/33cc998a94a562cd3de041cb5934673ec5da4018","sha":"33cc998a94a562cd3de041cb5934673ec5da4018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commits/33cc998a94a562cd3de041cb5934673ec5da4018"}],"sha":"1c52a7fe16f41cbcc9ac793bcddf013306b0464f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commits/1c52a7fe16f41cbcc9ac793bcddf013306b0464f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16282460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commits/33cc998a94a562cd3de041cb5934673ec5da4018/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:53:14Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:53:14Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"message":"fix(auth): review round — no verification email, direct set-email, hide derived everywhere\n\nAddresses the two-axis review of d74c0a0ee:\n\nSpec fixes:\n- Every changeEmail save was firing a ''Verify your email'' message\n  (better-auth sends when emailVerification.sendVerificationEmail is\n  configured). The emailVerification block is removed — nothing sends\n  verification email anymore; password reset still sends. As a side\n  benefit, NEAR sign-ins no longer attempt to verify the unreachable\n  synthetic mailbox (sendOnSignIn against emailVerified: false users).\n- Legacy passkey users (created before the emailVerified flip) could\n  not save an email: changeEmail required verification for\n  emailVerified: true accounts. New /set-email endpoint gates on the\n  synthetic-address check instead of the flag, so it works for them\n  with no backfill migration. It rejects already-registered addresses,\n  marks a saved address emailVerified: true (so invitation gating\n  sees it), and refreshes the session cookie.\n- The change-email scope creep is removed: AddEmailDialog is\n  add-only; Settings shows Add affordances, never Change.\n\nStandards fixes:\n- sessionStorage ''addEmailPromptPending'' magic-string dance extracted\n  to markAddEmailPromptPending (auth ui) / consumeAddEmailPromptPending\n  (main ui) helpers.\n- onSelect(id) plumbing through NextStepsList replaced with a direct\n  onAddEmail prop; stepLink is exhaustive again.\n- Shadowed ''pending'' in the dashboard toast effect renamed away.\n- Comment blocks stripped from synthetic-email helpers and tests.\n\nAlso unreported: the working tree carries a parallel in-progress\nonboarding feature; only files/hunks belonging to this change are\ncommitted.","tree":{"sha":"4809cb8abc8d1efefcf817d63d543b58b318172d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/trees/4809cb8abc8d1efefcf817d63d543b58b318172d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/commits/33cc998a94a562cd3de041cb5934673ec5da4018","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16282460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commit/33cc998a94a562cd3de041cb5934673ec5da4018","node_id":"C_kwDOT-K1MdoAKDMzY2M5OThhOTRhNTYyY2QzZGUwNDFjYjU5MzQ2NzNlYzVkYTQwMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commit/d74c0a0eeec7b2498c56d6c008cdc47132fdcf15","sha":"d74c0a0eeec7b2498c56d6c008cdc47132fdcf15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commits/d74c0a0eeec7b2498c56d6c008cdc47132fdcf15"}],"sha":"33cc998a94a562cd3de041cb5934673ec5da4018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commits/33cc998a94a562cd3de041cb5934673ec5da4018"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16282460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commits/d74c0a0eeec7b2498c56d6c008cdc47132fdcf15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:31:51Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:31:51Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"message":"feat(auth): capture email post-passkey; hide synthetic addresses\n\nPasskey / SIWN signup fabricates a placeholder email (passkey-<hex>@…,\ntemp-<hex>@…, or <local>@near.email) that the user never chose and\ncannot receive mail at. Two problems: (1) no UI let users attach a real\nemail; (2) settings and identity surfaces displayed the fake as if\nreal.\n\nFixes:\n\n- passkey-sign-up.ts: create synthetic users with emailVerified: false\n  (was true), unlocking better-auth''s updateEmailWithoutVerification\n  path. SIWN already defaulted to false.\n- auth-instance.ts: enable user.changeEmail with\n  updateEmailWithoutVerification so authClient.changeEmail({ newEmail })\n  saves directly — no OTP, no confirmation email.\n- isSyntheticEmail helper (ui + auth plugin ui): centralised detection\n  of the three fabricated shapes.\n- AddEmailDialog: single-field dialog; validates via HTML5 email, saves\n  through changeEmail, refreshes session cache, toasts.\n- Dashboard: new ''add-email'' next step for signed-in users without a\n  real email; IdentityCard shows an inline Add affordance and never\n  renders synthetic addresses.\n- Settings Profile / Auth Methods / Security: hide synthetic emails\n  everywhere, add Add/Change email affordances, fix hasPassword lie for\n  passkey users.\n- One-time post-signup toast on the dashboard (sessionStorage flag)\n  with an Add email action.\n- Audit: use-identity, admin context row, member card all skip\n  synthetic emails.","tree":{"sha":"621feadc113bc0a0d3af9d2fccc45d5ce367a279","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/trees/621feadc113bc0a0d3af9d2fccc45d5ce367a279"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/commits/d74c0a0eeec7b2498c56d6c008cdc47132fdcf15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16282460?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem