rganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commits/08cd24e59a1b87ffde9ecede0a1b76e43f7fc6eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:46:55Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:46:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(everything-dev): treat *.railway.internal db hosts as local (no TLS verification) (#264)\n\nRailway private-network Postgres presents a self-signed certificate chain\nno client CA bundle can verify, so bare non-local URLs failed plugin and\nauth boots with ''self signed certificate in certificate chain''. Those\nhosts are VPC-scoped private traffic — resolvePoolSsl now returns\nssl: false for them, same as localhost / host.docker.internal.","tree":{"sha":"dc68042e1ef8cb1aa4e88ed0d0567f5c9b408308","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/trees/dc68042e1ef8cb1aa4e88ed0d0567f5c9b408308"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/commits/08cd24e59a1b87ffde9ecede0a1b76e43f7fc6eb","verification":{"payload":"tree dc68042e1ef8cb1aa4e88ed0d0567f5c9b408308\nparent 7b262a6c959cb5024bd6b6bc2e1bb91ab505b9db\nauthor Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com> 1790484415 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790484415 -0500\n\nfix(everything-dev): treat *.railway.internal db hosts as local (no TLS verification) (#264)\n\nRailway private-network Postgres presents a self-signed certificate chain\nno client CA bundle can verify, so bare non-local URLs failed plugin and\nauth boots with ''self signed certificate in certificate chain''. Those\nhosts are VPC-scoped private traffic — resolvePoolSsl now returns\nssl: false for them, same as localhost / host.docker.internal.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquJ+/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABG8QAJ2oncdECv8MizFccVHmPp/0\nqFyYb1UVseqBivqJdxsf6u0ARNtubn7ZW2NObauYpHMFh9GkxoDrLa2eW9g8m3pR\nEcCpTxF+BchuOituaMokLyCqhFgfoy9glGAK7Z0q614Q1mDs3Lww55yIo47L8NoS\nRbrtennqHeEXMNboYxTdREzUziKYgRoNzWHn0bphpRsOlaw/MbZLzKjEyNcNEOWx\nd5WLQHIi9f1ps0kgxCmJ8bU3tBs+WiYC7ERBnDDqG27cyMz//lwV7gvkNNMSAFZN\nzVK/cPMvDyN55Gwk1lCLOxxaJ2VBemaqFAc2n+JSf16JnOFgfjVQwSyC6R6K4Wpi\nXEWOMr1GEhgjIEo8f9BHzvJF63wOdhtD1YqqQNuekMQGHI1yD7yKuj5BbksPJGNo\n2/uMQQ/9qjpuwLwiYLQh51dANcl2tqNd2t+sY0TMpc4P+p0v/kzRf85brc3w7idP\nc3ZukfyMWSTGH93WeFORRYmPHIfdud1hxOY8P+ZVa1WlzicU1hbpYQF+6pWDlqzt\nHDQkVbOvd3ZdA3hf612QIYljbjO4FmoxoOtUhpuDGhen+pMcxFl/460xerRtj7h+\n8ajKho1HmBY+awPdj7mzPzy8KqOdX17Zni4OEZRC4hKpNTEL88Mje1muNXv2WaS9\nAmdvy4igjl+YS0mCCzGv\n=Ixf/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T04:46:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/