gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elliotBraem","id":16282460,"login":"elliotBraem","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjgyNDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elliotBraem","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/commits/5ec019adb8aa4f32132e6c7100084dbbe5906f43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:06:28Z","email":"elliot@ejlbraem.com","name":"Elliot Braem"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:06:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(api,auth): user-owned tenant spawn + gateway-zone binding auto-verify + localhost passkey rpID (#176)\n\napi:\n- spawnTenant (POST /tenants/spawn): session-gated, one-transaction tenant +\n  primary binding owned by the session''s linked NEAR account (wallet or\n  passkey-derived 0s...); publishStatus pending_funding for 0s owners\n- getSpawnStatus (GET /tenants/spawn/{tenantId}) for owner-scoped polling\n- tenants.owner_user_id migration; ownerKind gains \"user\"\n- authorizedTenant authorizes user-owned tenants; listTenants returns\n  personal tenants for org-less users\n- bindings under configured gatewayDomains auto-verify at creation (platform\n  owns that DNS); custom domains keep TXT verification\n- new gatewayDomains api variable (descriptors + bos.config.json)\n\nauth plugin:\n- passkey RP ID resolves to the local hostname when the auth origin is\n  localhost/127.0.0.1 so dev passkeys work; PASSKEY_RPID overrides","tree":{"sha":"2321fef2d949da17b21d33fe549face6188afec0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/trees/2321fef2d949da17b21d33fe549face6188afec0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NEARBuilders/citynode.app/git/commits/5ec019adb8aa4f32132e6c7100084dbbe5906f43","verification":{"payload":"tree 2321fef2d949da17b21d33fe549face6188afec0\nparent a1e1cba8c34cff6ee17627a66ec2077beef8ef13\nauthor Elliot Braem <elliot@ejlbraem.com> 1790291188 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790291188 -0500\n\nfeat(api,auth): user-owned tenant spawn + gateway-zone binding auto-verify + localhost passkey rpID (#176)\n\napi:\n- spawnTenant (POST /tenants/spawn): session-gated, one-transaction tenant +\n  primary binding owned by the session''s linked NEAR account (wallet or\n  passkey-derived 0s...); publishStatus pending_funding for 0s owners\n- getSpawnStatus (GET /tenants/spawn/{tenantId}) for owner-scoped polling\n- tenants.owner_user_id migration; ownerKind gains \"user\"\n- authorizedTenant authorizes user-owned tenants; listTenants returns\n  personal tenants for org-less users\n- bindings under configured gatewayDomains auto-verify at creation (platform\n  owns that DNS); custom domains keep TXT verification\n- new gatewayDomains api variable (descriptors + bos.config.json)\n\nauth plugin:\n- passkey RP ID resolves to the local hostname when the auth origin is\n  localhost/127.0.0.1 so dev passkeys work; PASSKEY_RPID overrides","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtaz0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAg3cQAB8bUpT5QROzdZcQmLMbdz8H\nLIJn3yGiLn9Tt7SFWBs8b9FTCuw1i/SibwaICtjeuXifSPdISWqd15JxVshyO4Sl\noWLEndZ1z26TE0AQcQpE/FY+TBeS6oxc43+3CUrL/ISPlQm2xwE96dY4VynG7AGx\nvMe5QK6igaTZ2tzkbT2w/MJf9L1o8QqbUolB4xLw3YslRwlERecWDQeDWLPcfvk8\ntJ3QqvR22LDoaO4jd3Ihq3SLs+1O5Um+sKKSAa4S6dB/MxOWrxYBQoyW8GWr3GWP\nUZ78qfB7Ii7DzdEnsN9eGyfZ8lGBFuOih9CDk31pQbjjAArdYp72OdocCBPN/upk\nvT+oFsK5+xBJUHAo8k4+U9IQL8mXI1UvST686nPXsQcQlGW2SuFX9l3h0CUtAXPm\n8F/gFDhbpkLTmekGpAHzx2MGsZNB8N1Zb93